%% Activity diagram: report and moderation
flowchart TD
  A([User presses Report]) --> B[Pick category and who it is about]
  B --> C[Write summary and details]
  C --> D{Summary 3+ chars, details 10+ chars?}
  D -- no --> E[Show error] --> C
  D -- yes --> F{Reporter active, not admin, under 5 open reports?}
  F -- no --> G([Refused])
  F -- yes --> H[Save report as Open]
  H --> I[Admin opens Reports, oldest open first]
  I --> J{Action}
  J -- Resolve --> K[Mark Resolved with resolution text]
  J -- Ban offender --> L{Offender is self or an admin?}
  L -- yes --> M[Refused]
  L -- no --> N[Ban account and resolve report]
  N --> O([Offender gets 403 on login and writes])
  K --> P([Done])
